  "content": {
    "equation": "Infusion Rate:\nInfusion Rate = (Dose * 60) / (Drug Amount / Infusate Volume)\n• Infusion Rate is calculated in mL/hour\n• Dose is input in mg/minute\n• Drug Amount is input in mg\n• Infusate Volume is input in mL",
    "notes": [
      "This calculator is intended for use in adult patients to calculate infusion rates for continuous infusions (eg, lasting >1 hour).",
      "Mean daily doses >2.1 g/day have been associated with hypotension."
    ],
    "conditional_notes": [
      "Concentration is above 2\nmg/mL; administer via a central venous catheter"
